00:38:10.210 --> 00:38:12.530
in the 40s, 50s, 60s, and 70s,

00:38:12.530 --> 00:38:14.870
meant being the first company listed

00:38:14.870 --> 00:38:17.343
under a category, and AAA worked.

00:38:18.520 --> 00:38:20.653
